1
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:13,105
在世界的尽头，有一片从来没有船经过的海。
At the edge of the world, there is a sea where no ship has ever sailed.

2
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:20,487
海中央，有一座小小的灯塔。灯塔里，住着一个老机器人。
In the middle of it stands a tiny lighthouse. And in the lighthouse lives an old robot.

3
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,516
他的名字，叫阿灯。
His name is Deng.

4
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:33,239
晚上好，大海。今天，也要好好发光哦。
Good evening, sea. Let's shine our best tonight, too.

5
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:43,335
三百年来，阿灯每天晚上都会点亮灯塔。可是，从来没有一艘船来过。
For three hundred years, Deng has lit the lighthouse every night. But not a single ship has ever come.

6
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:48,669
要是有人，能看见这束光，就好了。
If only someone could see this light.

7
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,536
咦？那是，什么？
Huh? What... is that?

8
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,095
掉进海里了！
It fell into the sea!

9
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:16,241
呜呜，好冷，好黑。
Hic... so cold... so dark...

10
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:22,289
别怕，别怕。我叫阿灯。你是从天上掉下来的吗？
Don't be scared. I'm Deng. Did you fall from the sky?

11
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:27,379
我叫小光。我在天上追流星，一不小心，就掉下来了。
I'm Guang. I was chasing shooting stars, and... I slipped and fell.

12
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:32,067
天亮以前，我一定要回家。不然，我就会熄灭的。
I have to get home before sunrise. Or else... my light will go out.

13
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:36,427
别担心。我们一起想办法！
Don't worry. We'll figure it out together!

14
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,244
一、二、三，飞！
One, two, three... fly!

15
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,583
哈哈，再高一点！
Haha! Higher!

16
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:50,317
那就，再高一点！
Then... higher it is!

17
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:01,329
哈哈哈！阿灯，你好笨呀！
Hahaha! Deng, you're so clumsy!

18
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,833
阿灯，你一直都是一个人吗？
Deng... have you always been alone?

19
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:09,983
是啊。不过今天晚上，不是了。
Yes. But not tonight.

20
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:15,673
阿灯，我好像，越来越暗了。
Deng... I think I'm getting dimmer.

21
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:24,345
灯塔的光，能照得很远很远。也许，也能照到天上！
The lighthouse can shine very, very far. Maybe... all the way to the sky!

22
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:34,508
还不够，还差一点点。
Not enough... just a little more.

23
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,727
阿灯，那是你的心。不要！
Deng, that's your heart. Don't!

24
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:44,156
三百年了，我一直在等一艘船。
For three hundred years, I've been waiting for a ship.

25
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:48,544
原来，我等的，是你。
Now I know. I was waiting for you.

26
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:57,569
阿灯，阿灯！
Deng! Deng!

27
00:02:58,200 --> 00:03:00,777
回家吧，小光。
Go home, Guang.

28
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:22,143
谢谢你，守灯人。
Thank you, keeper of the light.

29
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:27,057
阿灯！以后每天晚上，我都会在天上，看着你！
Deng! Every night from now on, I'll be up there, watching you!

30
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:31,699
好。我也会一直，为你发光。
Okay. And I'll keep shining for you. Always.

31
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:49,260
从那以后，每当阿灯点亮灯塔，天上总有一颗星星，一闪，一闪，回答他。
From then on, whenever Deng lit the lighthouse, one star in the sky would twinkle back. Blink. Blink.

32
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:54,479
原来，每一束光，都会被看见。
Because every light, in the end, is seen by someone.

